### `tests/safety.rs:42`
## Lt. Cmdr. Data Tue Apr 15th, 2369 at 14:00

The assertion only checks the safety flag *before* arming. We should also assert that arming the weapon while safeties are engaged returns Err(SafetyEngaged).
